➤ TP QUERY PLAN[12,-1,0]  𝄀
Project  𝄀
  ->  Sort  𝄀
        Sort Key: mo_fulltext_alias_0.__mo_ft_doc_id INTERNAL  𝄀
        ->  Sort  𝄀
              Sort Key: mo_fulltext_alias_0.__mo_ft_score DESC  𝄀
              ->  Table Function on fulltext2_search
drop database ft2_char_padding;
